    "zh": "全都是 P/Invoke 声明与薄封装，不含业务判断。左上枚举与读取窗口信息，左下查状态与矩形；中间是聚焦与层级；右上三个查询类（DWM 遮盖、进程名、响应探测）；右下是输入 API 与结构体布局。",
    "en": "Pure P/Invoke declarations and thin wrappers, no business judgement: enumerate and read windows, query state and geometry, control the foreground, then three specialised queries (DWM, process name, responsiveness) and the input APIs on the right."
